      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "Make a video explaining how password reset works in our web app: the user says they forgot their password, the app looks up their account, emails them a one-time link, and the user opens it and chooses a new password."
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "I've drawn the password reset flow as a graph: the user, your web app, the users database, and the email service, with five steps from \"Forgot password\" to \"New password.\" The app and the users database sit inside a \"Your app\" zone.\n\nDoes the graph look right? Tell me what to change, or approve it and I'll move on to the story.",
        "toolCalls": []
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "The graph looks good. I approve it."
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "The graph is approved. Before I write the script, let's agree the story:\n\n- **Audience:** People who use the app, not its developers.\n- **Takeaway:** A reset link works once, and only for an hour.\n- **Shape:** Problem, how it works, outcome. The video opens on someone who can't remember their password, walks through the five steps, and ends with them back in the app.\n- **Hook:** \"Someone can't remember their password.\"\n\nShould I go with this? Tell me if you want a different takeaway, audience, or hook, or if the video should stress or leave out anything, such as the one-hour expiry.",
        "toolCalls": []
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "Yes, that story works for me. Go ahead and write the script."
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "I wrote the script: one scene with five beats, about 31 seconds (estimated until the voice is generated). It opens on someone who can't remember their password and ends with them signed in. The one-hour, use-once rule comes up when the email link is sent, with a callout on the email service.\n\nIs the script right? If so, approve it and I'll move on to the style. You can also ask me to change any beat.",
        "toolCalls": []
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "The script looks good. I approve it."
      },
